&lt;p&gt;To close this pull request, make a commit to your master/trunk branch&lt;br/&gt;
with (at least) the following in the commit message:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This closes #1769&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;commit 00b1dd3cca7b98c629765476a18875e7a382f758&lt;br/&gt;
Author: Igor Drozdov &amp;lt;igor_drozdov@epam.com&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Date:   2016-12-14T13:30:33Z&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Make it possible to use absolute local repo path in dependency downloader&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Old implementation expected localRepoPath to be relative to ZEPPELIN_HOME.&lt;br/&gt;
    It created broken path with absolute localRepoPath&lt;br/&gt;
    (e.g. C:\Users\User\AppData\Local\Temp\..\C:\......)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Huge amount of tests passed absolute path to newRepositorySystemSession.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Path.resolve(...) works fine if parameter is absolute path&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;</comment>
