&lt;p&gt;    @Leemoonsoo Thank you for reply!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    I forgot about tests, it&apos;s my fault.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Tests didn&apos;t pass `zeppelin.dep.localrepo` property to interpreter. That&apos;s why DependecyResolver got `null`. Old implementation used string &quot;null&quot; as folder name =)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    I think it&apos;s better not to pass null as repo path. I fixed tests to pass temporary folder as repo path&lt;/p&gt;


